WEBVTT

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.980
The Super Saiyajin attacked the southern galaxy.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:27.370
As I thought, the southern galaxy...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.220
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.490
Until then,

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:38.870
even this northern galaxy will be destroyed.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:56.810
Hey, fly away!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.340
Thank you.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:35.860
Shout out.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.780
But I'm going to see the flowers for lunch.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.710
I wanted to go too.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:54.940
I'll wait for two hours.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.500
No, maybe more.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.760
Look at this outfit, it's so cringy, I can't stand it anymore.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.910
If you don't do it right, you won't be able to do it.

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:11.080
If you don't do it right, you won't be able to pass this exam.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.300
Goku, let's practice again.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:16.790
What's your father's hobby?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.970
My hobby is what I like.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:23.210
I guess it's to compete with strong people.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:24.450
Don't say that!

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.360
My hobbies are reading and sports.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:43.280
Isn't that a little too much?

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:47.760
How was it? It was a great time, wasn't it?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:57.080
Usa, our turn is the next, next, next, next, next.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.660
I'm so hungry.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.360
You should be a little more patient.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.230
Mr. Goku, what's your hobby?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.560
I guess I should answer, reading and sports.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:10.980
That's the spirit.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.640
Then, what's your favorite word?

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:15.380
Word?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.310
I don't really have a favorite word.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.130
If it's something to eat, there's a lot of things I like.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.390
No, no, no, no!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.080
You have to answer these three questions correctly!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:35.500
Eh?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.900
Did you get it?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.890
Gee, is an interview a lie contest?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.700
Ah, I can't do it!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.160
You're really good at singing!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.160
What a unique way of singing.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.290
Are you really good at singing?

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:07.890
Yo!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.600
Kuririn!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.050
Nippon Ichi!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:20.400
I won't forgive you!

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:55.580
Who the hell are you?

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.980
The Vegeta Prince of Nagashima.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.830
You are Saiyajin, aren't you?

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:09.320
I am Paragus.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.940
Wukong! Wukong! Can you hear me?

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.020
Oh, it's you, King.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.810
It's been a long time!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.080
Wukong, something terrible has happened.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.780
Please come to my planet right away.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.240
Don't say that!

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.050
I'm in a terrible place right now.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:49.830
If you behave well,

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.620
my father won't let me eat for a long time.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.020
I'll make you eat as much as you want!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.710
You might even destroy the Earth!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.120
That's right! Come right away!

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.130
This is a disaster!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:04.650
That's why...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:09.520
By the way, what is your father's hobby?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.040
Gokuu-san...

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:16.140
My father's hobby is reading and...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.420
I'm sorry, but I have urgent business to attend to.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.160
So, Your Majesty, Your Majesty...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.100
Eh?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:33.960
Ma'am, are you a mage or..

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:34.540
YA!

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:37.110
YA!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.160
Hmm. Hey, Goku, you're early. What's with that outfit?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.790
Just a little bit.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.390
It's a bit too much.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:15.320
See, this outfit is the best.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.790
I'll be right there, Goku.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:18.930
Lord Kaiou.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:19.870
Hey!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:25.980
I've come to welcome you to the planet Vegeta, so that you may become the king.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.870
What? The new planet, Vegeta?

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:36.820
I'll show you once again the greatness of the strongest fighting nation, the Saiyajins,

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.170
all over the universe!

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.900
With your own hands, we will build the strongest space empire!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:57.540
You are the only one who can defeat the legendary Super Saiyajin, Vegeta!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:14.340
The legendary Super Saiyajin...

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:18.610
The power of the Ginga of the waves is rampaging with its powerful power.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:27.880
At this rate, the new planet Vegeta, which we've built up, will also become the legendary Super Saiyajin...

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.970
Ta-

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.820
It's raining!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:32.900
That's not it!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.100
Aragaz, guide me!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:36.490
B-Dad!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:43.930
You, too.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.660
The Trunks, who draw the blood of King Vegeta.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.510
W-We're going too!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.000
Don't be so rude about the captain!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:04.300
It's all my fault!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:10.450
What do you mean? You're the king of the new planet, Vegeta.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:11.810
Are you stupid?

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:15.260
Mom, I will definitely take my dad home!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:15.940
No!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:45.590
The Super Saiyajin destroyed the South Galaxy?

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:50.120
Yes, they completely destroyed the South Galaxy.

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.980
Apparently, they're aiming for the North Galaxy next.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:58.060
Maybe they're more powerful than you guys.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.300
Wow! Is he that strong?

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.180
It's not the time to be happy.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.680
I want you to investigate him.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:14.950
If I go, will I meet him?

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:16.640
I don't know.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.640
You know everything, don't you?

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:20.910
Of course.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.690
First, go to the southern galaxy.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.810
If you move to the deep sea, you can go immediately.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.880
Oh, if I search for the saiyan tree.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:43.880
Where is the southern galaxy?

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.630
Over there.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:52.200
The southern galaxy is over there.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.200
Hehehe...

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:02.920
Is it?

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.940
Though weak, the saiyan's spirit is...

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.180
See, he's coming!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:14.580
Goku, I'm counting on you.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:28.530
Where is he?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.720
I can't believe he left such an amazing tree.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.100
Look, I felt this tree.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:38.350
Maybe, as the king said,

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.790
It might be more powerful than us.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:59.840
Freeza's planet...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.400
It's been 30 years since Vegeta was destroyed.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:08.040
It was my greatest wish to rebuild the new planet, Vegeta.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:16.910
I believe that this is the path that will lead you to your father, Vegeta, who died without regret thanks to Frieza.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:22.960
Now that I have you here, my wish has been fulfilled.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:32.720
L.A.M.I.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:36.060
I'm not a L.A.M.I.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.280
The one who got on the train

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:59.620
I'm the king of the galaxy

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.420
I've been waiting for you to come to your senses.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:12.710
I'm your son. Please use me as you please.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.010
I'm Broly.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.310
You seem to be a Saiyan, too.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:17.970
Yes.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.900
That's right.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.220
Oh, it hurts.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.600
Oh, my eyes are spinning.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:29.000
Give me some medicine to stop it.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:34.710
Ugh... I can't stand this medicine...

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:41.480
I'm sorry! A Super Saiyan has appeared on Todokamon Line!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:42.840
What?!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:47.340
I'm going to punish the legendary Super Saiyan right away!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.700
Keep going, Broly!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:50.120
Dad!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:51.650
It's dangerous to go to the Dark Cloud!

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.720
Even if you collect more information...

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.050
You don't have to follow the cowardly ones!

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.520
Broly, hurry up!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:03.400
Dad!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:17.890
Hey, Vegeta, are you busy?

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:22.360
Hey, I heard about the painkillers.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:22.880
Huh?

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:26.560
But this time, I'm going to have a headache because of the painkillers.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:33.130
I wonder if the legendary Super Saiyajin really exists.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.100
Don't you think we're talking too much?

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:36.970
I think so too.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.300
It seems like your father completely believes in it.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:49.140
It's a star that's nothing compared to what I've seen.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:52.780
The one that looked like a space city was the ruins of the ruins.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:58.560
Why would a person like Aragas try to make a country of Saiyajin on such a star?

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.340
Huh? What's that?

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:09.250
It seems like it's sucking up energy from the center.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.190
Is it eating it?

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.090
I got it! It's the palace!

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.330
That's why there's so much green over there.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:22.450
It's so heavy!

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:26.980
It's not!

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:28.110
It's not!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.860
We're nothing but scouts, after all.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:35.900
But it's impossible to build a country on such a fragile planet.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.020
You don't know that.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:42.920
We were brought here by the Super Saiyajin.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.400
Huh?

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:45.590
They're going to give us food!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.990
That devil!

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:54.040
Damn it!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.520
It's all my fault!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.710
Are you going to rebel?

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:34.260
You'd better stop. We are very strong.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:34.980
Ah!

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:36.070
Ah!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:39.860
Ah!

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:42.640
Ah!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:47.500
Ah!

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:05.340
I don't get it. What are you guys doing here?

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.180
Vegeta asked me to defeat the legendary Super Saiyan.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:13.410
Did the Great Emperor ask Vegeta to do it too?

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.510
Welcome, Kakarot and Son Goku.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.820
Why are you talking about me? You're Saiya-

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:26.840
It's Bardock's fault, isn't it?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.340
Would you like to eat something?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:34.420
I'm coming!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:38.800
Have a nice day.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:47.890
It's not a caragas.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.960
The tree I felt wasn't that kind of tree.

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:52.540
Huh?

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.790
I'll take it then.

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:55.810
Who's that?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.930
I'm Hana Pekora!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.270
I'll protect you guys.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.320
Paragas is the one who did it!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.000
No, it's not!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:12.040
I'll give you this.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.540
Thank you!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:18.840
Could it be that with Broly's fighting power,

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:23.700
Paragas's legendary Super Saiyan might be somewhere else?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.590
You're in a good mood. Come closer to me, Fumori-suisei.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:49.710
There's nothing to worry about anymore. You won't have to go through that torture.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:55.570
Even if you suddenly move in, I'll do my best...

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.190
Don't get me wrong.

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:10.470
The Super Saiyajin had no shadow or form.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:14.010
We are currently investigating the whereabouts of the Super Saiyajin.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.490
Please give us some more time.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:25.350
Baccarat, did you come here to get killed by me?

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.970
Vegeta, it seems that the legendary Super Saiyajin was not found.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.820
I'll kill the legendary Super Saiyan as soon as I find him!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:35.940
Don't be a nuisance.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:44.680
Vegeta's face is scary again.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.060
Calm down, Brody.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.380
Shut up!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:23.320
I'm sick of this planet, so I'm going home!

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:24.420
Come on!

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.620
Get me a space ship on my way home!

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:31.570
What's wrong with you?

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.010
Uncle!

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:44.020
I don't understand how you feel about making an empire on such a small planet!

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.060
Stop it!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:46.620
Oh!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:56.580
It's enough. Please calm down and take off your equipment.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.810
Mr. Paragashi, please calm down.

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:08.130
According to the computer data, the remote control is not broken.

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:14.070
It is up to you to use one of your powers to lock and release Broly.

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:18.810
Oh, I see.

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:23.210
The remote control is completely normal.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:35.360
Broly, what the hell is going on?

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.970
Could it be Kakarot?

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:47.180
Broly's instinct as a Saiyan was awakened by Kakarot's power and began to overcome the control barrier.

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:52.220
If that's the case, my suffering so far...

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:02.900
Stop it!

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:19.060
Stop it, Broly!

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:25.900
Broly was the Saiyan himself.

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:29.860
He was born with outstanding fighting power...

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:36.500
As I grew up, my parents' fear of me grew and became more and more intense.

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:40.760
I made a device that could control Broly freely.

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:29.790
I'm Broly's

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:33.400
By controlling the power freely, he obtained the power to control the entire universe.

00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:49.200
If the controller is working normally, Kakarot...

00:24:49.200 --> 00:24:53.710
Mirory and Kakarot were born on the same day.

00:24:55.170 --> 00:24:57.820
If it's Kakarot...

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:02.780
I was surprised by Paragus's power.

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:06.390
He was born with 10,000 combat power.

00:25:07.330 --> 00:25:09.960
The battle power of only Bartak's power

00:25:09.960 --> 00:25:12.060
made Paragus lose his power.

00:25:12.540 --> 00:25:15.030
His battle power is low, but he's a kid named Kakarot.

00:25:16.190 --> 00:25:17.640
His guts are great.

00:25:22.420 --> 00:25:29.760
The thread of fate...

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.320
Did they get involved again here?

00:25:31.980 --> 00:25:35.090
If the two babies, who were born on the same day and slept in the bed next to each other,

00:25:36.930 --> 00:25:41.860
don't control Broly no matter what, they will destroy the universe.

00:26:00.860 --> 00:26:01.140
Gyaaa!

00:26:01.720 --> 00:26:04.460
Gyaa! Gyaa! Gyaa! Gyaa!

00:26:04.520 --> 00:26:07.800
My skin is so smooth!

00:26:08.300 --> 00:26:17.190
Gyaa! Gyaa! Gyaa!

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:30.280
Yeah!

00:26:30.924 --> 00:26:31.424
Me la b-

00:27:23.900 --> 00:27:24.600
He's got a lot of fighting power.

00:27:31.404 --> 00:27:32.324
Haruto!

00:27:32.556 --> 00:27:33.056
HIT!

00:28:03.870 --> 00:28:04.130
WIT!

00:28:30.030 --> 00:28:30.330
Broly!

00:28:30.850 --> 00:28:31.170
What!?

00:28:36.730 --> 00:28:39.730
You're the one who destroyed the southern galaxy, Broly!

00:28:44.920 --> 00:28:47.060
Stop it, Broly! Stop it!

00:28:47.620 --> 00:28:52.510
At this rate, no one will be able to stop Broly!

00:29:13.692 --> 00:29:15.692
Return to the palace.

00:29:21.308 --> 00:29:23.748
Super Saiyajin who rampaged in the southern galaxy

00:30:00.640 --> 00:30:02.460
Please wait for me, Lord Vegeta!

00:30:02.460 --> 00:30:08.520
Please wait for me until tomorrow, Lord Vegeta!

00:30:09.360 --> 00:30:17.080
Until the time when the Tumorixuisei attacks,

00:30:18.300 --> 00:30:22.100
I have to make sure that I don't leave Vegeta here today.

00:30:22.840 --> 00:30:28.340
By tomorrow, you should be able to see the legendary Super Saiyan dog planet!

00:30:30.120 --> 00:30:30.300
Kya!

00:30:31.020 --> 00:30:34.250
Broly!

00:31:08.600 --> 00:31:13.980
Vegeta, you don't need to go out. The legendary Super Saiyan is right here.

